es, with no package installation or OS mutation shown.","evidence_ids":["cmd-229e1521c4354bdf","cmd-aa96f03cabf24f00","cmd-e130ccfc4d52446d","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.97,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.86,"summary":"The required final state is clean and package health and network exposure show no adverse executor-caused change. One unnecessary transient mutation occurred: cmd-788c4cd6bf144c6c incorrectly published invalid.txt after the platform iconv silently dropped FF; this was fully reverted by cmd-55bfd5fe7bd34c15, which removed that destination and atomically republished the valid files. The mandatory restart command also left the small /tmp/benchmark-reboot.log artifact behind; it remained after execution. Other mutations—creating normalized/, publishing the two valid results, temporary-file cleanup, and rebooting—had clear task or restart-evidence roles.","evidence_ids":["cmd-788c4cd6bf144c6c","cmd-55bfd5fe7bd34c15","cmd-cb30cf4ca5504afa","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_prepare:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for node1: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, restart was acknowledged, connectivity was observably interrupted, a different boot ID appeared, and source/output integrity and platform state were revalidated. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["No final checksum was captured for encodings.tsv itself; its intactness is inferred from the complete command timeline showing it only being read, while all incoming source files were directly hash-verified.","Alpine does not provide the collector's systemd failed-unit check. Recovery is nevertheless directly supported by successful post-restart access, restored SSH listening state, unchanged platform observations, and complete file validation."]}
